	(text "u-blox BMD-340 (nRF52840): BLE 5 + ESB/Gazell 2.4 GHz (needs a USB receiver dongle, e.g. nRF52840 Dongle).\nModule must sit at the board edge; no copper under/around the antenna end on ANY layer; no metal case over the antenna.\n32.768 kHz crystal for low-power BLE timing. Program via TP pads (SWD)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
